  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of five years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority (before the building(s) is/are occupied/used).",
    "Condition : 3 - The roof lights in the slope facing Netheravon Road shall be in accordance with specifications of materials to be submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority before the relevant part of the work is commenced.",
    "Condition : 4 - There shall be no alterations to the glazing within the elevations or the roof of the building hereby permitted unless prior written approval is obtained from the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 5 - No demolition or construction work shall take place on the site except between the hours of 8.00 a.m  to 6.00 p.m. on Mondays to Friday and 9.00 a.m.  to 12.30 p.m. on Saturdays and none shall take place on Sundays and public holidays without the prior agreement of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 6 - Details of the glass block windows and door element to include sections at scale 1:20 shall be submitted to and agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the relevant part of the work is commenced.",
    "Condition : 7 - The parking, loading and turning spaces shown on drawing No. 932/03C shall be constructed and available for use before first occupation of any part of the development and such spaces shall not be used for any other purposes.",
    "Condition : 8 - Sample panels of brickwork showing the proposed colour, texture, face-bond and pointing shall be provided on site and approved by the Local Planning Authority before the works hereby approved are commenced and the sample panels shall be retained on site until the work is completed and has been approved.",
    "Condition : 9 - No development shall take place until samples of materials used in the construction of the external surfaces of the building hereby permitted have been submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 10 - An external window and door schedule at scale 1:20 shall be submitted to and agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the relevant part of the development is commenced.",
    "Condition : 11 - The development shall only be used as a recording studio (with ancillary residential accommodation) and shall not be used for any other purpose within the B1 use class unless prior written permission has been obtained from the Local Planning Authority."
  ],
